                  code: "3.1.1.LI.2",
                  text: "Discuss how to use leisure time profitably.",
                  exemplar: "General Learning Approach: In the context of schools with large sizes, the RMEC should utilize case studies, video watching (movie scenes), drama/role play that will offer opportunities for discussions afterwards.\n\nWhere appropriate the following pedagogies may also be implemented:\n\nActivity-Based Learning: Through drama, demonstrate how leisure time is used profitably.\n\nProject-Based Learning: Create group charts on how to use leisure time effectively.\n\nEnquiry Route: Proper use of leisure time",
